@title Cabinet: new plate holes show no animation under the harness
@area Cabinet
# The drill cue (a ring closing on each new hole) runs in the live app. The harness and Reduce motion show the plain plate, so pictures are stable. Place all drills the holes of every device and rail.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot plate-before
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Place all
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
shot plate-after-place
check_layout
